jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135767894,imgsize-827987.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Father charged after baby found buried alive in dog crate]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135767176.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[An 11-month-old infant named Koah Sharp was discovered alive after being buried in a dog crate. His father, Michael Comer, has been charged with attempted murder after the search lasted for 24 hours. Rescuers found Koah underground, which helped him survive due to cool temperatures and an air pocket. Authorities were alerted when his grandmother reported him missing shortly after she left him with his father.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-11-month-old-south-carolina-boy-survived-after-being-buried-underground-in-a-dog-crate-for-24-hours-rescuers-heard-koah-sharp-crying-and-his-father-has-now-been-charged-with-attempted-murder-/articleshow/135767176.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-11-month-old-south-carolina-boy-survived-after-being-buried-underground-in-a-dog-crate-for-24-hours-rescuers-heard-koah-sharp-crying-and-his-father-has-now-been-charged-with-attempted-murder-/articleshow/135767176.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T16:54:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135767229,imgsize-345866.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Samuel L. Jackson, wife honoured by charity that has helped 50,000 families affected by autism, Parkinson's]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135765682.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Samuel L. Jackson and LaTanya Richardson Jackson received the Clarence and Jacqueline Avant HollyRod Humanitarian Award at a charity gala. The event recognized their humanitarian efforts and contributions to supporting families affected by autism and Parkinson's disease. Hosted by Holly Robinson Peete and Rodney Peete, the gala focused on raising funds and awareness for the challenges these families face.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/on-november-7-samuel-l-jackson-and-his-wife-were-honoured-by-a-charity-that-has-helped-more-than-50000-families-and-provided-over-4-million-in-assistance-for-autism-and-parkinsons-disease/articleshow/135765682.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/on-november-7-samuel-l-jackson-and-his-wife-were-honoured-by-a-charity-that-has-helped-more-than-50000-families-and-provided-over-4-million-in-assistance-for-autism-and-parkinsons-disease/articleshow/135765682.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T16:58:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135765700,imgsize-1009998.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ted Turner's family to auction 20 Montana ranch paintings estimated at $20 million for conservation cause]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135765476.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ted Turner's family is set to auction 20 exquisite paintings by renowned 19th-century American artists, aiming to benefit the Turner Foundation. This collection, showcasing breathtaking landscapes of the American West, carries both cultural and financial significance. The auction, planned for January 2027, underscores Turner's commitment to philanthropy and environmental causes, with proceeds directed towards conservation projects that preserve vital natural habitats.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/ted-turners-family-is-putting-about-20-landscape-paintings-from-his-montana-ranch-up-for-auction-with-an-estimated-20-million-sale-set-to-benefit-a-conservation-foundation-after-his-death-in-may/articleshow/135765476.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/nature/ted-turners-family-is-putting-about-20-landscape-paintings-from-his-montana-ranch-up-for-auction-with-an-estimated-20-million-sale-set-to-benefit-a-conservation-foundation-after-his-death-in-may/articleshow/135765476.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135765580,imgsize-134200.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Punjab-origin newlywed couple and brother-in-law killed in NZ crash; families seek repatriation]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135765582.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/punjab-origin-newlywed-couple-and-brother-in-law-killed-in-nz-crash-families-seek-repatriation/articleshow/135765582.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/punjab-origin-newlywed-couple-and-brother-in-law-killed-in-nz-crash-families-seek-repatriation/articleshow/135765582.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T16:14:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135765901,imgsize-1421233.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Former Yankees manager Joe Torre's childhood inspires charity for abused children]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135765145.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Former New York Yankees manager Joe Torre and his wife Ali founded Safe At Home in 2002. The charity now runs 30 school-based programmes offering counselling and safe spaces to children affected by domestic violence and trauma.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/joe-torre-grew-up-in-a-home-marked-by-violence-the-charity-he-founded-with-wife-ali-now-runs-30-school-support-sites-offering-counselling-and-safe-spaces-for-children-affected-by-abuse-and-trauma/articleshow/135765145.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/joe-torre-grew-up-in-a-home-marked-by-violence-the-charity-he-founded-with-wife-ali-now-runs-30-school-support-sites-offering-counselling-and-safe-spaces-for-children-affected-by-abuse-and-trauma/articleshow/135765145.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T17:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135765482,imgsize-55996.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Court rejects Virginia couple's claim over highway expansion near their home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135761881.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Virginia appeals court has rejected a couple’s claim for additional compensation over an I-495 highway expansion, ruling that they could seek damages only for the temporary easement taken from their property, not losses linked to the wider road project. Their expert had estimated that the project could reduce the property’s value by nearly $500,000.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/virginia-paid-29700-for-a-temporary-1458-square-foot-easement-behind-a-couples-home-their-expert-claimed-a-highway-expansion-caused-almost-500000-in-losses-but-an-appeals-court-rejected-that-claim/articleshow/135761881.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/virginia-paid-29700-for-a-temporary-1458-square-foot-easement-behind-a-couples-home-their-expert-claimed-a-highway-expansion-caused-almost-500000-in-losses-but-an-appeals-court-rejected-that-claim/articleshow/135761881.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T15:52:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135764565,imgsize-248622.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[15-year-old Canadian hockey player reaches $50,000 cancer treatment fundraising goal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763838.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-15-year-old-canadian-hockey-player-facing-treatment-for-a-rare-cancer-has-received-community-support-with-a-50000-fundraising-target-reached-as-his-family-seeks-specialist-care-in-the-us/articleshow/135763838.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/a-15-year-old-canadian-hockey-player-facing-treatment-for-a-rare-cancer-has-received-community-support-with-a-50000-fundraising-target-reached-as-his-family-seeks-specialist-care-in-the-us/articleshow/135763838.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T15:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135763951,imgsize-796500.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet 'Popeye': Pablo Escobar's hitman who claimed involvement in 3,000 killings before becoming a YouTuber]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763123.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jhon Jairo Velásquez, infamously known as 'Popeye', served as a notorious hitman under drug lord Pablo Escobar, reportedly carrying out over 250 murders, including numerous high-profile hits. After 23 years of incarceration, he turned to social media fame with his YouTube channel 'Repentant Popeye,' where he ruminated on his violent past and critiqued governmental actions. Sadly, he succumbed to oesophageal cancer in 2020 following a short imprisonment.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/meet-jhon-jairo-popeye-velsquez-pablo-escobars-hitman-who-helped-coordinate-3000-killings-before-becoming-a-famous-colombian-youtuber-recounting-his-days-in-the-medelln-cartel/articleshow/135763123.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/meet-jhon-jairo-popeye-velsquez-pablo-escobars-hitman-who-helped-coordinate-3000-killings-before-becoming-a-famous-colombian-youtuber-recounting-his-days-in-the-medelln-cartel/articleshow/135763123.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T14:56:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135763192,imgsize-1105291.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Colin Cowdrey’s son wins £500,000 neighbour dispute over £3.85 million home]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763911.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/former-cricket-captain-colin-cowdreys-son-wins-500000-from-neighbour-after-legal-battle-over-3-85-million-country-home-dispute-began-over-a-strip-of-land-that-included-part-of-his-private-tennis-court/articleshow/135763911.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/former-cricket-captain-colin-cowdreys-son-wins-500000-from-neighbour-after-legal-battle-over-3-85-million-country-home-dispute-began-over-a-strip-of-land-that-included-part-of-his-private-tennis-court/articleshow/135763911.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T17:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135764107,imgsize-120619.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin trucker Ranjit Singh found guilty of smuggling 40kg cocaine worth $4.8m into Canada]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763922.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-origin-trucker-ranjit-singh-found-guilty-of-smuggling-40kg-cocaine-worth-4-8m-into-canada/articleshow/135763922.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/indian-origin-trucker-ranjit-singh-found-guilty-of-smuggling-40kg-cocaine-worth-4-8m-into-canada/articleshow/135763922.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T15:21:09+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135764042,imgsize-1020698.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Capital Murder Conviction: Yella Beezy gets life without parole; associate also sentenced]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763669.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a landmark ruling, Dallas rapper Yella Beezy has been handed a life sentence without parole for his orchestrating role in the capital murder of fellow rapper MO3, who was tragically shot in November 2020. After a rigorous six-year judicial process, Prosecutor Tommy Adams voiced his approval of the jury’s decision.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/yella-beezy-found-guilty-of-hiring-gunman-to-kill-rapper-mo3/articleshow/135763669.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/yella-beezy-found-guilty-of-hiring-gunman-to-kill-rapper-mo3/articleshow/135763669.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T15:18:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Mahima Sharma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135763985,imgsize-75283.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US Supreme Court rejects Roberto Clemente sons’ $45 million license plate appeal]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135711803.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Roberto Clemente’s sons faced a legal setback regarding their father's image on Puerto Rico’s license plates after the Supreme Court chose not to review their case. This outcome means the earlier rulings remain in force, despite the family's claims that their father’s likeness was used without consent for special plates honoring the 50th anniversary of his passing.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2022-puerto-rico-put-baseball-legend-roberto-clementes-image-on-license-plates-without-his-sons-permission-after-they-sought-45-million-in-damages-the-us-supreme-court-declined-their-appeal/articleshow/135711803.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2022-puerto-rico-put-baseball-legend-roberto-clementes-image-on-license-plates-without-his-sons-permission-after-they-sought-45-million-in-damages-the-us-supreme-court-declined-their-appeal/articleshow/135711803.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T15:09:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135711946,imgsize-73145.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US shuts 4-kilometre road twice a year to protect migrating snakes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135762101.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-closes-a-4-kilometre-road-twice-a-year-as-thousands-of-snakes-including-venomous-rattlesnakes-and-cottonmouths-migrate-between-a-swamp-and-limestone-cliffs-with-changing-temperatures/articleshow/135762101.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-closes-a-4-kilometre-road-twice-a-year-as-thousands-of-snakes-including-venomous-rattlesnakes-and-cottonmouths-migrate-between-a-swamp-and-limestone-cliffs-with-changing-temperatures/articleshow/135762101.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T14:40:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135762200,imgsize-2319726.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Shoebox of love letters reveals Witley Court heiress’s secret relationship]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135763485.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-shoebox-of-love-letters-found-in-a-1960s-archive-reveals-the-secret-romance-between-witley-court-heiress-dora-smith-and-noel-pearson-who-eventually-married-after-her-divorce-in-1929/articleshow/135763485.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-shoebox-of-love-letters-found-in-a-1960s-archive-reveals-the-secret-romance-between-witley-court-heiress-dora-smith-and-noel-pearson-who-eventually-married-after-her-divorce-in-1929/articleshow/135763485.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T16:40:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135763576,imgsize-104761.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bathroom leak floods Frontier flight, forces emergency landing in Chicago]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135762004.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A Frontier Airlines flight faced a critical situation as a bathroom sink started leaking profusely mid-air. While en route to Detroit, the crew had to make an emergency landing at Chicago O'Hare International Airport. Noticing water flooding the cabin, pilots acted swiftly, concerned about damaging electronics. Footage revealed alarming amounts of water accumulating on the cabin floor, though the aircraft was safely landed without further incident.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mayday-mayday-bathroom-leak-floods-frontier-flight-forces-emergency-landing-in-chicago/articleshow/135762004.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mayday-mayday-bathroom-leak-floods-frontier-flight-forces-emergency-landing-in-chicago/articleshow/135762004.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-12T14:37:52+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135762917,imgsize-34888.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Clemente's sons lose Supreme Court appeal over Puerto Rico's use of his image]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135758831.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/roberto-clementes-three-sons-sought-45-million-after-puerto-rico-put-